00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:33.467
A nail is what a tool

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:34.267
works on,

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.300
so it does not belong.

00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:38.200
Alright,

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.467
a number series!

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:41.233
Ninety,

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:41.967
eighty-three,

00:00:41.967 --> 00:00:42.733
seventy-six,

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:43.500
sixty-nine,

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.000
and then...

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.267
what comes next?

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.033
A.

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:48.800
Sixty-one,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.533
B.

00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:50.300
